{"ts":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z","author":"codex-root","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Contract\\n\\nUse only the documented enabled-entity display endpoint. Preserve the raw compact contract for maximum token efficiency; decode into stable descriptive keys only when explicitly requested. Generic ws call remains the forward-compatible escape hatch."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"hac-ahl7"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Implement compact entity registry display discovery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Add fully typed transport and CLI support for config/entity_registry/list_for_display, preserve raw compact keys by default, provide semantic decoded output, and support entity/domain/device/area/count/limit workflows across validated formats."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agents","api","entity-registry","formats","live-e2e","typescript","websocket"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-07-25T21:02:44.778Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":180},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Typed transport reflects every documented compact field without any or guessed external types; registries help, schema, filters, count, limit, raw compact and decoded outputs are tested in all supported formats; Actual built hassio command passes read-only structural live acceptance without recording entity data"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"Official docs and live structural response agree on root keys and field union"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"complete-agent-home-assistant-interface"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"token-efficient-enabled-entity-discovery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Reduce Home Assistant registry payload and LLM token cost."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Agents can discover enabled entity metadata without downloading private and disabled full registry records."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"A typed, documented, format-valid compact registry interface."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The endpoint is officially documented and live but only reachable through generic passthrough."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"hac-r17v"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":98},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-compact-registry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"2026.7.24"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"hac-96i2","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-n0ix","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-soop","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-suj3","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z","author":"codex-root"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Live schema proof found root keys entities/entity_categories and the documented compact field union; only counts and field names are retained."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.778Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Do not expose raw entity rows, device IDs, areas, 